# NoteForge-AI

A Next.js application for taking and organizing notes. This repository contains the frontend app, some backend helpers, and Prisma schema used by the project.

Features
- User authentication (Supabase)
- Dashboard with note listing, creation, viewing, and editing
- Rich text editor (TipTap)
- Tailwind CSS styling

Getting started

1. Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

2. Run the development server

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000 in your browser.

Project structure (top-level)

- `app/` — Next.js app directory (routes & pages)
- `src/` — application source files
- `public/` — static assets
- `prisma/` — Prisma schema & migrations (if used)
- `package.json` — project scripts and dependencies

Learn more

- Next.js: https://nextjs.org/docs
- TipTap: https://tiptap.dev/

